ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a role-playing game held at home, each family member portrayed their favorite characters. Yang Ming, who is a big fan of martial arts novels, particularly admires Yang Guo and has always wanted to be a hero like him. So, Yang Ming dressed in all black, carried a large eagle toy on his back, and even left one arm without a sleeve. When his mom asked, \"Who are you?\" without hesitation, Yang Ming replied, \"I am Yang Guo.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy did Yang Ming say so?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. In the family role-playing game, Yang Ming is playing the role of Yang Guo.\nB. He truly believes he is the character Yang Guo from the novel.\nC. By saying he is Yang Guo, Yang Ming feels closer to his idol.\nD. Yang Ming has a strong preference for the character Yang Guo in martial arts novels.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0010322115218031115,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5865b9aa9dc5a833d40df","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475611378,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:26:51","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7abb5c7d65da4c2b890880c4dc49813b"}